  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliamentary Oversight Dashboard: Improving Transparency and Accountability in Parliament</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective(s): To improve accountability and transparency of South African Parliamentary proceedings as a mechanism for enhancing oversight of the Executive. This will empower citizens, and Members of Parliament, to hold the National Legislature and Executive to account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective(s):&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Effectively use data and technology to improve Parliamentary accountability;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Improve transparency of Parliamentary proceedings;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Enable more accurate tracking and monitoring of&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parliamentary proceedings;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Provide a user-friendly and open-source dashboard for citizens and MPs to access and utilise the information for both research and policy-design purposes;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Utilise the Inter-Parliamentary indicators for Democratic Parliaments to advance a transparent Parliament;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Reinvigorating Parliament as a site for democratic accountability;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf; Support an ecosystem of South African Parliamentary oversight and participation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
